                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "State of Decay YOSE combines various RPG elements, resulting in an unpredictable and thrilling zombie survival adventure. This zombie-bashing, resource managing post-apocalyptic treasure continues to shine amidst the crowd of mindless zombie games. The choices I took or neglected to take due to prolonged deliberation impacted the lives of those outside my immediate circle, reflecting a reality that encompassed not only the decisions I made but also transcended the influence of my personal actions.",
